{txt}
{com}. 
. /********************************************************************
> Does the private-public NNM gap vary with local social composition?
> 
> Console output only.
> 
> For each region and comparison group, estimate:
> 
>     NNM_i =
>         comparison group
>       + private
>       + local higher-ranking share
>       + all two-way interactions
>       + comparison x private x local higher-ranking share
>       + controls
>       + district FE
>       + error_i
> 
> The key coefficient is:
> 
>     1.comp_group#1.private#c.higher_share_psu_loo
> 
> It asks whether the DIFFERENCE in the private-public NNM gap between
> the comparison group and Forward Hindus changes as the local share
> of higher-ranking social groups increases.
> 
> Definitions requested:
> 
>     Adivasi:
>         higher ranking = OBC + Forward Hindu + Muslim
> 
>     Dalit:
>         higher ranking = OBC + Forward Hindu + Muslim
> 
>     OBC:
>         higher ranking = Forward Hindu only
> 
>     Muslim:
>         higher ranking = Forward Hindu only
> 
> Local composition is constructed using ALL rural births in NFHS-4/5
> among the five analytic social groups, before restricting the
> regression sample to public/private facility births.
> 
> Preferred measure:
>     leave-one-out PSU higher-ranking share
> 
> Also reports:
>     - p-value on the three-way interaction
>     - the group difference in the private-public gap at the
>       25th, 50th, and 75th percentiles of local composition
>     - sensitivity using the ordinary non-LOO PSU share
> ********************************************************************/
. 
. 
. *------------------------------------------------------------
. * User settings
. *------------------------------------------------------------
. 
. local outcome nnm
{txt}
{com}. 
. local regions up_bihar non_upbihar_focus nonfocus
{txt}
{com}. 
. local groups 1 2 3 5
{txt}
{com}. 
. local groupname1 "Adivasi"
{txt}
{com}. local groupname2 "Dalit"
{txt}
{com}. local groupname3 "OBC"
{txt}
{com}. local groupname5 "Muslim"
{txt}
{com}. 
. local residence rural
{txt}
{com}. local r 4,5
{txt}
{com}. 
. * Same controls as the previous local-composition diagnostic.
. local controls ///
>     i.prior ///
>     i.underweight_projected ///
>     i.male ///
>     i.momunder20 ///
>     i.multiples ///
>     i.v190 ///
>     i.birth_order ///
>     i.illiterate ///
>     i.round
{txt}
{com}. 
